  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Reduce Youth Unemployment Through Capacity Building and the Involvement of the Diaspora</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce Burundian youth unemployment, a factor of fragility for Burundi, through the engagement of the Burundian diaspora; creating sustainable jobs and providing Burundian youths with the business and professional skills necessary to succeed in the formal labor market.</narrative>
  </description>
